### Ranking Formula

The core ranking formula follows the design specified in the documentation:

```
Rank Score = (
    (event_expert_count × EVENT_WEIGHT) +
    (topic_expert_count × TOPIC_WEIGHT) +
    (organization_member_count × ORG_WEIGHT) +
    (testimony_count × TESTIMONY_WEIGHT) +
    (document_count × DOCUMENT_WEIGHT) +
    (quote_count × QUOTE_WEIGHT)
)
```

Default weights as specified in documentation:
- Direct connections (events, topics, organizations, testimonies): 1.0
- Enhanced connections (quotes, primary event involvement): 1.5
- Secondary connections (indirect references): 0.5

